repository-code: "https://github.com/nomar2/Tower"
url: "https://github.com/nomar2/Tower"
abstract: >-
  Tower GCS is an Android ground control station for UAVs running ArduPilot.
  It is a maintained fork of DroidPlanner/Tower, updated to build and run on
  modern Android (10 through 16), with MAVLink 2 support, a reworked GUIDED
  follow-me, more reliable mission transfer, and connectivity over USB serial
  (SiK radios), Wi-Fi, TCP and UDP.
